<title>UK: Unilever to sell chemicals business to ICI.</title>
<headline>Unilever to sell chemicals business to ICI.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-Dutch Unilever announced on Wednesday it is to sell its speciality chemicals business to Britain's ICI for eight billion dollars.</p>
</text>
